  14:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
  15:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****  ===============================================================================
  16:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     [..]
  17:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****         (#) Enable DMA2D clock using 
  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****             RCC_APB2PeriphResetCmd(RCC_APB2Periph_DMA2D, ENABLE) function.
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****             
  20:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****         (#) Configures DMA2D
  21:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) transfer mode 
  22:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) pixel format, line_number, pixel_per_line
  23:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) output memory address
  24:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) alpha value
  25:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) output offset
  26:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) Default color (RGB)
  27:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****            
  28:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****         (#) Configures Foreground or/and background
  29:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) memory address
  30:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****           (++) alpha value
