 578:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c **** /** @defgroup DMA2D_Group2 Interrupts and flags management functions
 579:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****  *  @brief   Interrupts and flags management functions
 580:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****  *
 581:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c **** @verbatim
 582:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****  ===============================================================================
 583:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****             ##### Interrupts and flags management functions #####
 584:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****  ===============================================================================
 585:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c **** 
 586:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to configure the DMA2D 
 587:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****          Interrupts and to get the status and clear flags and Interrupts 
 588:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****          pending bits.
 589:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     [..] The DMA2D provides 6 Interrupts sources and 6 Flags
 590:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     
 591:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     *** Flags ***
 592:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     =============
 593:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     [..]
 594:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_CE : Configuration Error Interrupt flag
 595:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_CAE: CLUT Access Error Interrupt flag
 596:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_TW:  Transfer Watermark Interrupt flag
 597:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_TC:  Transfer Complete interrupt flag
 598:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_TE:  Transfer Error interrupt flag
 599:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_FLAG_CTC: CLUT Transfer Complete Interrupt flag
 600:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       
 601:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     *** Interrupts ***
 602:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     ==================
 603:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****     [..]
 604:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_CE: Configuration Error Interrupt is generated when a wrong 
 605:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****                        configuration is detected
 606:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_CAE: CLUT Access Error Interrupt
 607:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_TW: Transfer Watermark Interrupt is generated when 
 608:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****                        the programmed watermark is reached 
 609:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_TE: Transfer Error interrupt is generated when the CPU trying 
 610:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****                        to access the CLUT while a CLUT loading or a DMA2D1 transfer 
 611:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****                        is on going       
 612:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_CTC: CLUT Transfer Complete Interrupt 
 613:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_dma2d.c ****       (+) DMA2D_IT_TC: Transfer Complete interrupt         
